{"type":"message","id":"dd1e6d36","parentId":"9393d276","timestamp":"2026-03-12T11:40:43.875Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:f6b9edc7-5375-4a0a-b88b-3989ad8ab3eb skill-evolution-hourly] 执行自动进化任务：1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能（搜索关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation）；2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能；3. 安装有价值的技能；4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\nCurrent time: Thursday, March 12th, 2026 — 7:40 PM (Asia/Shanghai)\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1773315643874}}
{"type":"message","id":"da716e4b","parentId":"dd1e6d36","timestamp":"2026-03-12T11:40:57.592Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"这是一个定时任务，要求我执行自动进化任务。让我分解一下：\n\n1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能（关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation）\n2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能\n3. 安装有价值的技能\n4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\n\n首先，我应该检查是否有 clawhub 相关的技能可以使用。让我看看可用的技能列表。\n\n我看到有一个 \"clawhub\" 技能：\n- clawhub: Use the ClawHub CLI to search, install, update, and publish agent skills from clawhub.com. Use when you need to fetch new skills on the fly, sync installed skills to latest or a specific version, or publish new/updated skill folders with the npm-installed clawhub CLI.\n\n这个技能正好适合这个任务。让我先读取这个技能文件了解如何使用。\n\n但根据指引，我应该先检查是否有相关的技能。clawhub 技能明确适用于\"search, install\"技能的场景，所以我应该使用它。\n\n让我先读取 clawhub 技能文件。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我来执行自动进化任务。首先读取 ClawHub 技能指南，然后搜索和筛选技能。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a931fba5692a4076b808949a","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/opt/homebrew/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/clawhub/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":12065,"output":288,"cacheRead":3392,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15745,"cost":{"input":0.012065,"output":0.0009216000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0006784,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.013665}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773315643875}}
{"type":"message","id":"5f45e44c","parentId":"da716e4b","timestamp":"2026-03-12T11:40:57.598Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_a931fba5692a4076b808949a","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: clawhub\ndescription: Use the ClawHub CLI to search, install, update, and publish agent skills from clawhub.com. Use when you need to fetch new skills on the fly, sync installed skills to latest or a specific version, or publish new/updated skill folders with the npm-installed clawhub CLI.\nmetadata:\n  {\n    \"openclaw\":\n      {\n        \"requires\": { \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"] },\n        \"install\":\n          [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"node\",\n              \"kind\": \"node\",\n              \"package\": \"clawhub\",\n              \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"],\n              \"label\": \"Install ClawHub CLI (npm)\",\n            },\n          ],\n      },\n  }\n---\n\n# ClawHub CLI\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nnpm i -g clawhub\n```\n\nAuth (publish)\n\n```bash\nclawhub login\nclawhub whoami\n```\n\nSearch\n\n```bash\nclawhub search \"postgres backups\"\n```\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nclawhub install my-skill\nclawhub install my-skill --version 1.2.3\n```\n\nUpdate (hash-based match + upgrade)\n\n```bash\nclawhub update my-skill\nclawhub update my-skill --version 1.2.3\nclawhub update --all\nclawhub update my-skill --force\nclawhub update --all --no-input --force\n```\n\nList\n\n```bash\nclawhub list\n```\n\nPublish\n\n```bash\nclawhub publish ./my-skill --slug my-skill --name \"My Skill\" --version 1.2.0 --changelog \"Fixes + docs\"\n```\n\nNotes\n\n- Default registry: https://clawhub.com (override with CLAWHUB_REGISTRY or --registry)\n- Default workdir: cwd (falls back to OpenClaw workspace); install dir: ./skills (override with --workdir / --dir / CLAWHUB_WORKDIR)\n- Update command hashes local files, resolves matching version, and upgrades to latest unless --version is set\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773315657597}}
{"type":"message","id":"f4e7d56f","parentId":"5f45e44c","timestamp":"2026-03-12T11:41:04.939Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我了解了 clawhub CLI 的使用方法。现在我需要：\n\n1. 使用 `clawhub search` 搜索多个关键词\n2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能\n3. 使用 `clawhub install` 安装有价值的技能\n4. 生成报告\n\n让我开始搜索。由于有多个关键词，我会进行多次搜索来获取更全面的结果。关键词包括：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation\n\n我将执行多次搜索来覆盖这些关键词。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c4452ee9d6d34fcabb073b8e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search calendar"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_13c342e60007441489eb10c2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search task"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fc3f3622f02f42c0bb471a38","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search document"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_99ef084d82b744ab84255565","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search meeting"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e381340c2b4f46638b68de7d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search email"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":767,"output":178,"cacheRead":15424,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16369,"cost":{"input":0.000767,"output":0.0005696000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0030848000000000004,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.004421400000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773315657599}}
